WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:01.169
Welcome to AI Discoverers.

00:00:01.289 --> 00:00:03.919
Elementary learners explore where AI appears in everyday life

00:00:04.039 --> 00:00:06.377
while building curiosity, creativity, and safe technology habits.

00:00:06.497 --> 00:00:08.251
Students recognize patterns, ask thoughtful questions,

00:00:08.371 --> 00:00:10.125
and learn to use AI responsibly.
